<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108718" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολογ-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take into account, take account of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. εἰς τὴν μίσθωσιν</span>
			<i>put</i> the payment <i>to the account</i> of . . , ib.<i><span class="en">
				2492.26
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			 in pass. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ισθεισὼν τῶν γεγενημένων προσόδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					364.92
				</span></i>
			 (Ephesus, 
			<span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολογ-ισθήσεται</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τιμὴ εἰς τὰς γινομένας ἀναφοράς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRev.Laws</u>
					34.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τιμὴν ἐκ τῶν ὀψωνίων ὑ.</span>
			<i>deduct</i> the price from . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.39.15
			</span></i>: so in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Geog.</u>
				1.14.6
			</span></i>, and 
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.13.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>take into account,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνδυνον ὑ. τοῦ ζῆν ἢ τεθνάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					28b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς παρεληλυθότας πόνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					231b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀλγεινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					480c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.99
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				197
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ὑπελογίζοντο τὰς
			νίκας</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ
			Κίμωνος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				And.
				4.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν ὑ. τὸ ξενικὸν [τῶν νόμων], ἂν
					βελτίους φαίνωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					702c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. . . εἰ ἀποθνῄσκειν δεῖ πρὸ τοῦ
					ἀδικεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					48d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
